  "description": "Build a production-ready WordPress .htaccess - security hardening, hotlink protection, redirects, caching, login protection, and SQLite-WP rules - right in your browser. Free, private, nothing is uploaded.",
  "canonical": "https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/htaccess-generator/",
  "body": "\n<article class=\"page-tools-tool\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPage\">\n<!-- ═══ 2. tool hero ═══ -->\n<section class=\"section-sm\" style=\"padding-top:var(--sp-6);padding-bottom:0;position:relative\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n<ol class=\"breadcrumb-list\">\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/\" class=\"bc-home-link\"><span class=\"bc-prompt\">&gt;_</span>Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/tools/\">Tools</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">WordPress .htaccess Generator</span></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"WordPress .htaccess Generator\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/htaccess-generator/\"}]}</script>\n<div class=\"about-hero\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-6)\">\n<p class=\"label label-green\">&gt;_ tools --htaccess</p>\n<div class=\"about-intro\">\n<div class=\"about-text\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin:16px 0;letter-spacing:-.03em\">WordPress .htaccess Generator</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.7;max-width:56ch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTick the blocks you want and get a production-ready WordPress .htaccess - security hardening, hotlink protection, redirects, caching, login protection, and SQLite-WP rules. Assembled entirely in your browser; nothing is uploaded.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--leaderboard\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 3. tool behaviour (.htaccess generator) ═══ -->\n<div id=\"htapp\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<main class=\"htapp-wrap\">\n<div class=\"htapp-card htapp-form\" id=\"form\">\n<!-- SECURITY -->\n<div class=\"sec-head\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>SECURITY</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sec_headers\">\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sec_headers\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">HTTP security headers<span class=\"badge\">mod_headers</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy and a few hardening headers on every response.</span></span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sec_xmlrpc\">\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sec_xmlrpc\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Block XML-RPC (soft)<span class=\"badge\">mod_rewrite</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Returns 403 for xmlrpc.php. Note: this breaks Jetpack, and XML-RPC apps/plugins.</span></span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sec_uploads\">\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sec_uploads\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Disable PHP execution in wp-content/uploads<span class=\"badge\">scoped</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Blocks any .php under wp-content/uploads only - theme/plugin PHP is untouched.</span></span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sec_sig\">\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sec_sig\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Hide server signature + version<span class=\"badge\">server</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">ServerSignature Off and ServerTokens Prod.</span></span>\n</label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sec_dotfiles\">\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sec_dotfiles\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Block hidden / dotfiles<span class=\"badge\">FilesMatch</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Denies .htaccess, .git, .env, .user.ini and friends.</span></span>\n</label>\n<!-- HOTLINK -->\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>HOTLINK PROTECTION</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"hot_enable\">\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"hot_enable\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Enable hotlink protection<span class=\"badge\">403</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Returns a clean 403 for image files requested from referers outside your allowed list.</span></span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"opt-panel\" id=\"panel_hot\" hidden>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">Your site domain (always allowed)</span>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"hot_domain\" value=\"example.com\" placeholder=\"example.com\"></label>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">Additional allowed referer domains (one per line or comma-separated)</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<textarea id=\"hot_domains\" placeholder=\"partner.com\"></textarea></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"hot_empty\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"hot_empty\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Allow empty referers</span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Direct visits, bookmarks and some legit clients send no referer.</span></span></label>\n</div>\n<!-- REDIRECTS -->\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>REDIRECTS</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"red_https\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"red_https\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Force HTTPS<span class=\"badge\">301</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Redirect http to https. Disable if you sit behind a proxy/Cloudflare.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"red_www\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"red_www\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Canonical WWW convention<span class=\"badge\">301</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Add or remove www to avoid duplicate-host SEO issues.</span></span></label>\n<div class=\"opt-panel\" id=\"panel_www\" hidden>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">WWW behaviour</span>\n<select id=\"www_mode\"><option value=\"add\">Add www</option><option value=\"remove\">Remove www</option></select></label>\n</div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"red_slash\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"red_slash\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Enforce trailing slash convention<span class=\"badge\">301</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Make non-file URLs consistently end in a slash (or not).</span></span></label>\n<div class=\"opt-panel\" id=\"panel_slash\" hidden>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">Slash behaviour</span>\n<select id=\"slash_mode\"><option value=\"add\">Add trailing slash</option><option value=\"remove\">Remove trailing slash</option></select></label>\n</div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"red_custom\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"red_custom\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Custom redirects<span class=\"badge\">301</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">One per line: /old-path  https://new.example/. Optionally start with a status code.</span></span></label>\n<div class=\"opt-panel\" id=\"panel_custom\" hidden>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">Redirect map (from → to, per line)</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<textarea id=\"custom_rules\" placeholder=\"/old-page  /new-page\"></textarea></label>\n</div>\n<!-- CACHING -->\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>CACHING &amp; SPEED</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"cache_expires\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cache_expires\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Browser caching (mod_expires)<span class=\"badge\">mod_expires</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Long-lived Expires headers for images, CSS, JS and fonts.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"cache_hdrs\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cache_hdrs\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Cache-Control for static assets<span class=\"badge\">mod_headers</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">immutable, max-age=1 year for static assets.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"cache_gzip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cache_gzip\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Gzip / deflate text responses<span class=\"badge\">mod_deflate</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Compress HTML, CSS, JS, XML and JSON on the wire.</span></span></label>\n<!-- LOGIN -->\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>LOGIN PROTECTION</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"login_ip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"login_ip\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Login IP allowlist<span class=\"badge\">mod_rewrite</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Only allow wp-login.php from the static IPs you list. Use with care.</span>\n<span class=\"warn\" id=\"login_warn\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden>Only add your own STATIC IP. A dynamic residential IP will lock you out of wp-admin.</span></span></label>\n<div class=\"opt-panel\" id=\"panel_login\" hidden>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">Allowed IP addresses (one per line)</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<textarea id=\"login_ips\" placeholder=\"203.0.113.7\"></textarea></label>\n</div>\n<!-- SQLITE-WP -->\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>SQLITE-WP (the moat)</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sql_dbdir\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sql_dbdir\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Deny access to /wp-content/database/<span class=\"badge\">403</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">The whole SQLite DB lives there - 403 it.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sql_files\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sql_files\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Block .sqlite / .sqlite3 / .db / .sql<span class=\"badge\">Require</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Apache 2.4 Require all denied on those extensions anywhere.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sql_wp_cfg\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sql_wp_cfg\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Protect wp-config.php<span class=\"badge\">Require</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Deny direct HTTP access. Apache 2.4 syntax.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sql_indexes\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sql_indexes\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Options -Indexes<span class=\"badge\">server</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">No directory listings anywhere.</span></span></label>\n</div>\n<!-- OUTPUT -->\n<section class=\"htapp-card htapp-out\">\n<div class=\"out-cap\"><span>generated .htaccess</span><span class=\"line\" style=\"flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border-2)\"></span><span id=\"byteCount\" style=\"color:var(--dim)\">0 B</span></div>\n<div class=\"preview\"><code id=\"preview\"></code></div>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<button class=\"htapp-btn htapp-p\" id=\"copyBtn\">Copy .htaccess</button>\n<button class=\"htapp-btn htapp-ghost\" id=\"dlBtn\">Download .htaccess</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"foot\">no server · computed entirely in your browser · run through the generator any time</footer>\n"
}